 · exact one_div_le_one_div_of_le (by have := pow_pos ha 2; linarith) (by nlinarith [pow_le_pow_left₀ ha.le hle 2])
 · exact one_div_le_one_div_of_le (pow_pos ha 3) (pow_le_pow_left₀ ha.le hle 3)
